&#160;</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e6e7e8;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="padding-right:-1.93pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:2pt;font-weight:400;line-height:2.00pt">&#160;</span></div></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#e6e7e8;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">69,660&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#e6e7e8;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e6e7e8;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e6e7e8;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8212;</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e6e7e8;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#e6e7e8;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">119,660&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#e6e7e8;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><div style="margin-bottom:5pt;margin-top:5pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">&#8194;&#8202;Jeffrey A. Beck</span></div></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="2" style="padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">70,000&#160;</span></td><td style="padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;ver